{"id": "06cf2e7a-4d08-40e8-bb40-923a3d8afc3e", "slug": "aether-core-telemetry", "title": "Aether Core Telemetry", "description": "Aether Core UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Aether Core Telemetry\"\ndescription: \"Aether Core UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#34D399\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#34D399\"\n  background: \"#0A0A0A\"\n  surface: \"#71717A\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#71717A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"16px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Aether Core Telemetry\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Sourasith Phomhome (@madebysourasith). Views: 12; favorites: 6; remixes: 0.\nTags: ui, css, dashboard, app, interface.\n## Overview\nAether Core UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\n\nAether Core / Telemetry Stream Live Sync Phase Coherence 00.0 % Flux Variance 0.00 μV Resonance Cascade Limit 0% Control Relays Active Array Cluster IDX: 0x4F92\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nFollow the rendered preview for headline scale, supporting copy, navigation density, and component placement.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #34D399, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #34D399, background #0A0A0A, surface #71717A, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and JetBrains Mono for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Aether Core Telemetry</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@200;300;400&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@300;400&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#0a0a0a] text-zinc-300 min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center relative overflow-hidden font-sans antialiased selection:bg-emerald-500/20 selection:text-emerald-200\" style=\"font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\">\n\n    <!-- Ambient WebGL-style Background Simulation -->\n    <canvas id=\"bg-canvas\" class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none opacity-40 mix-blend-screen\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Main Dashboard Container -->\n    <main class=\"relative z-10 w-full max-w-4xl p-6 opacity-0 translate-y-8 transition-all duration-[1200ms] ease-out\" id=\"dashboard-panel\">\n\n        <!-- Premium Gradient Border Wrapper -->\n        <div class=\"relative w-full rounded-2xl p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-b from-zinc-500/20 via-zinc-800/10 to-zinc-900/50 shadow-[0_10px_60px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8)]\">\n\n            <!-- Structural Corner Accents -->\n            <div class=\"absolute -top-[1px] -left-[1px] w-4 h-4 border-t border-l border-zinc-400/40 rounded-tl-2xl z-20\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute -top-[1px] -right-[1px] w-4 h-4 border-t border-r border-zinc-400/40 rounded-tr-2xl z-20\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Glass Inner Panel -->\n            <div class=\"bg-[#0d0d0d]/85 backdrop-blur-2xl rounded-2xl w-full flex flex-col relative overflow-hidden\">\n\n                <!-- Header -->\n                <header class=\"flex items-center justify-between px-8 py-5 border-b border-zinc-800/40 bg-gradient-to-r from-white/[0.02] to-transparent\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                        <span class=\"text-zinc-500 text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">Aether Core</span>\n                        <span class=\"text-zinc-700 text-xs\">/</span>\n                        <span class=\"text-zinc-300 text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">Telemetry Stream</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 bg-emerald-950/20 border border-emerald-500/20 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full\">\n                        <div class=\"relative flex h-1.5 w-1.5\">\n                            <span class=\"animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-emerald-400 opacity-75\"></span>\n                            <span class=\"relative inline-flex rounded-full h-1.5 w-1.5 bg-emerald-400 shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(52,211,153,0.8)]\"></span>\n                        </div>\n                        <span class=\"text-emerald-400 text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">Live Sync</span>\n                    </div>\n                </header>\n\n                <!-- Hero Telemetry Section -->\n                <div class=\"px-8 pt-12 pb-10 relative\">\n\n                    <!-- Animated Signal Line Canvas (Background of Stats) -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-40 z-0 opacity-70 mask-image: linear-gradient(to top, black, transparent)\">\n                        <canvas id=\"signal-canvas\" class=\"w-full h-full\"></canvas>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between gap-12 relative z-10\">\n                        <!-- Primary Metric -->\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\">\n                            <span class=\"text-zinc-500 text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.2em]\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">Phase Coherence</span>\n                            <div class=\"flex items-baseline gap-3\">\n                                <span class=\"text-6xl font-light tracking-tight text-white drop-shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(255,255,255,0.1)]\" id=\"stat-coherence\">00.0</span>\n                                <span class=\"text-2xl font-light tracking-tight text-zinc-500\">%</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Secondary Metric -->\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 md:items-end\">\n                            <span class=\"text-zinc-500 text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.2em]\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">Flux Variance</span>\n                            <div class=\"flex items-baseline gap-3\">\n                                <span class=\"text-6xl font-light tracking-tight text-white drop-shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(255,255,255,0.1)]\" id=\"stat-variance\">0.00</span>\n                                <span class=\"text-2xl font-light tracking-tight text-zinc-500\">μV</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Load Meter Section -->\n                <div class=\"px-8 pb-10 relative z-10\">\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-end mb-4\">\n                        <span class=\"text-zinc-500 text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.15em]\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">Resonance Cascade Limit</span>\n                        <span class=\"text-zinc-300 text-xs font-mono\" id=\"meter-label\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">0%</span>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Precision Track -->\n                    <div class=\"h-[2px] w-full bg-zinc-900 rounded-full relative\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-20\" style=\"background: repeating-linear-gradient(to right, #71717a, #71717a 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 6px);\"></div>\n\n                        <!-- Active Fill -->\n                        <div id=\"meter-fill\" class=\"h-full w-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-600/40 to-emerald-400 relative transition-all duration-[2500ms] cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)\">\n                            <!-- Luminous leading edge -->\n                            <div class=\"absolute right-0 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-4 h-[4px] bg-white rounded-full blur-[2px] opacity-80\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"absolute right-0 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[1px] h-3 bg-white shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(52,211,153,1)]\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Footer Relays -->\n                <footer class=\"px-8 py-6 border-t border-zinc-800/40 bg-zinc-950/30 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6 relative z-10\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-8 w-full md:w-auto justify-between md:justify-start\">\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1.5\">\n                            <span class=\"text-zinc-500 text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.15em]\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">Control Relays</span>\n                            <span class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm font-normal\">Active Array Cluster</span>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Hardware Icons -->\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 border-l border-zinc-800/60 pl-8\">\n                            <button class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-md border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/40 flex items-center justify-center text-zinc-500 hover:text-white hover:border-zinc-600 hover:bg-zinc-800 transition-all duration-300 group relative\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:server-square-linear\" width=\"20\" class=\"group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </button>\n                            <button class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-md border border-emerald-500/30 bg-emerald-500/5 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-400 hover:bg-emerald-500/10 hover:shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(52,211,153,0.15)] transition-all duration-300 group relative\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:database-linear\" width=\"20\" class=\"group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform\"></iconify-icon>\n                                <div class=\"absolute -top-1 -right-1 w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 border-[1.5px] border-[#0d0d0d]\"></div>\n                            </button>\n                            <button class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-md border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/40 flex items-center justify-center text-zinc-500 hover:text-white hover:border-zinc-600 hover:bg-zinc-800 transition-all duration-300 group relative\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:cpu-bolt-linear\" width=\"20\" class=\"group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </button>\n                            <button class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-md border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/40 flex items-center justify-center text-zinc-500 hover:text-white hover:border-zinc-600 hover:bg-zinc-800 transition-all duration-300 group relative\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:radar-linear\" width=\"20\" class=\"group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 border border-zinc-800 rounded bg-zinc-900/40 text-zinc-400 text-xs font-mono tracking-[0.1em]\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">\n                        IDX: <span class=\"text-zinc-200\">0x4F92</span>\n                    </div>\n                </footer>\n\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n\n            // 1. Core UI Entrance Animation\n            setTimeout(() => {\n                const panel = document.getElementById('dashboard-panel');\n                panel.style.opacity = '1';\n                panel.style.transform = 'translateY(0)';\n\n                // Trigger Meter Fill\n                setTimeout(() => {\n                    document.getElementById('meter-fill').style.width = '84.2%';\n                }, 500);\n\n                // Run Number Counters\n                animateCounter('stat-coherence', 0, 99.8, 2000, 1);\n                animateCounter('stat-variance', 0, 0.04, 2000, 2);\n                animateCounter('meter-label', 0, 84.2, 2500, 1, true);\n            }, 150);\n\n            function animateCounter(id, start, end, duration, decimals, isPercentage = false) {\n                const el = document.getElementById(id);\n                let startTime = null;\n                const easeOutQuart = t => 1 - (--t) * t * t * t;\n\n                const step = (timestamp) => {\n                    if (!startTime) startTime = timestamp;\n                    const progress = Math.min((timestamp - startTime) / duration, 1);\n                    const current = start + (end - start) * easeOutQuart(progress);\n\n                    el.innerHTML = current.toFixed(decimals) + (isPercentage ? '%' : '');\n\n                    if (progress < 1) {\n                        window.requestAnimationFrame(step);\n                    }\n                };\n                window.requestAnimationFrame(step);\n            }\n\n            // 2. Telemetry Signal Line Canvas (Foreground Data Flow)\n            const sigCanvas = document.getElementById('signal-canvas');\n            const sigCtx = sigCanvas.getContext('2d');\n            let sigTime = 0;\n\n            function resizeSignal() {\n                sigCanvas.width = sigCanvas.offsetWidth * window.devicePixelRatio;\n                sigCanvas.height = sigCanvas.offsetHeight * window.devicePixelRatio;\n                sigCtx.scale(window.devicePixelRatio, window.devicePixelRatio);\n            }\n            window.addEventListener('resize', resizeSignal);\n            resizeSignal();\n\n            function drawWave(t, frequency, amplitude, color, width, glow = false) {\n                const w = sigCanvas.offsetWidth;\n                const h = sigCanvas.offsetHeight;\n\n                sigCtx.beginPath();\n                sigCtx.moveTo(0, h / 2);\n\n                for (let x = 0; x < w; x++) {\n                    // Combine multiple sine waves for a \"telemetry\" noise look\n                    let y = h / 2\n                        + Math.sin(x * frequency + t) * amplitude\n                        + Math.sin(x * frequency * 2.5 + t * 1.5) * (amplitude * 0.3);\n                    sigCtx.lineTo(x, y);\n                }\n\n                sigCtx.strokeStyle = color;\n                sigCtx.lineWidth = width;\n\n                if (glow) {\n                    sigCtx.shadowColor = 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4)';\n                    sigCtx.shadowBlur = 12;\n                } else {\n                    sigCtx.shadowBlur = 0;\n                }\n\n                sigCtx.stroke();\n            }\n\n            function animateSignal() {\n                const w = sigCanvas.offsetWidth;\n                const h = sigCanvas.offsetHeight;\n                sigCtx.clearRect(0, 0, w, h);\n\n                // Draw layered flowing lines\n                drawWave(sigTime * 0.8, 0.003, h * 0.25, 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03)', 1);\n                drawWave(sigTime * 1.2, 0.005, h * 0.15, 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05)', 1);\n                drawWave(sigTime * 1.5, 0.008, h * 0.35, 'rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.15)', 1.5, true); // Emerald accent\n\n                sigTime += 0.02;\n                requestAnimationFrame(animateSignal);\n            }\n            animateSignal();\n\n            // 3. Ambient WebGL-style Plane Simulation (Background)\n            const bgCanvas = document.getElementById('bg-canvas');\n            const bgCtx = bgCanvas.getContext('2d');\n            let bgTime = 0;\n\n            function resizeBg() {\n                bgCanvas.width = window.innerWidth;\n                bgCanvas.height = window.innerHeight;\n            }\n            window.addEventListener('resize', resizeBg);\n            resizeBg();\n\n            function animateBg() {\n                bgCtx.clearRect(0, 0, bgCanvas.width, bgCanvas.height);\n\n                const cy = bgCanvas.height * 0.5;\n                const lines = 30;\n\n                bgCtx.lineWidth = 1;\n\n                // Draw perspective moving grid\n                for(let i = 0; i < lines; i++) {\n                    // Calculate moving depth\n                    let depth = ((i * 20 + bgTime) % (lines * 20)) / (lines * 20);\n\n                    // Exponential curve for fake 3D perspective\n                    let yPos = cy + Math.pow(depth, 3) * (bgCanvas.height - cy);\n\n                    // Fade out in distance and edge\n                    let opacity = depth * 0.15 * (1 - depth * 0.2);\n\n                    bgCtx.beginPath();\n                    bgCtx.strokeStyle = `rgba(255, 255, 255, ${opacity})`;\n                    bgCtx.moveTo(0, yPos);\n\n                    // Add subtle wave to background grid\n                    for(let x = 0; x <= bgCanvas.width; x += 50) {\n                        let waveY = yPos + Math.sin(x * 0.002 + bgTime * 0.02) * (depth * 10);\n                        bgCtx.lineTo(x, waveY);\n                    }\n\n                    bgCtx.stroke();\n                }\n\n                bgTime += 0.5;\n                requestAnimationFrame(animateBg);\n            }\n            animateBg();\n\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "aether-core-telemetry.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/aether-core-telemetry.jpg", "source_name": "aether-core-telemetry-DESIGN.md", "views": 73, "forks": 4, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "5bd6211c-bd4c-467c-b442-4312cac4712c", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-02T00:39:08.598619+00:00"}